==Battleground==
*5 [[Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Snache]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Those Guys]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[HAPPI (Enemy)|HAPPI]] spawns as the boss.
**8 [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

